# Proof: F-V3-FILTER
# Top: v3_input_filter
# Assumptions: Initial sampled reset; arbitrary synchronized samples.
# Properties: Three-sample qualification and rejection of disagreeing samples.
# Method: temporal induction; bounded success alone is insufficient.
# Scope and abstractions: formal/README.md.

read_verilog -formal src/v3_input_filter.v
prep -top v3_input_filter
flatten
async2sync
dffunmap
sat -seq 5 -tempinduct -maxsteps 16 -set-assumes -prove-asserts -verify
